{"v":4,"catch":"通過政變捍衛世界！\n特種空軍作戰開始了！","desc":"“TASK FORCE HARRIER”是UPL在1989年發行的射擊遊戲。\n玩家駕駛Harrier V，這是一款基於Harrier 2的完全定制的先進戰鬥機，並展開部署以從舊派別發動的政變中拯救世界。\n收集物品以升級您的武器並在戰鬥中佔上風。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-05-20","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d503477eeb0cd1cf49ce6ef928f15bfa8ddf612bb09b6ecccd931963a55e15a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9d32ca847673a7b765849671636180e4e4d2541dcb460a2086103ec25582959c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4551ef4b16c99f53da33c83030eff37bcbc771b9537ff97857f5e50d216330c0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b1444a7028931bc7deaaac1f6c9eb5959295ef7b76aaefc13a090b796e7ebfa9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f9eaed45fa5ace8bd52aadfcda7a2380e1038c42cff37930035a170f9061f50d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8a3b3259eea5c2f10a56b863b666b5d6d23299164a71ceea1df5fd2c4a75efa.jpg"],"titleId":"01007eb014716000","dlc":[]}